  "description": "This dataset comprises auditory streaming and interoception recordings collected to investigate the relationship between auditory perceptual organization and interoceptive awareness. The study employs electroencephalography (EEG) to measure neural responses during auditory streaming tasks while simultaneously assessing interoceptive sensitivity. The dataset is organized according to the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS) standard, facilitating reproducible analysis and integration with other neuroimaging studies.",
